{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40523","headline":"鸱枭 · 苏拯","name":"鸱枭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲害未爲害，其如汚物类。\n斯言之一玷，流传极天地。\n良木不得栖，清波不得戏。\n曾戏水堪疑，曾栖树终弃。\n天不歼尔族，与夫恶相济。\n地若默尔声，与夫妖爲讳。\n一时怀害心，千古不能替。\n伤哉丑行人，兹禽亦爲譬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}